<div class="project-heading">
  <h3><a href="https://kysely.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kysely <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
</div>
<p>A type-safe SQL query builder for TypeScript.</p>
<p>What a ride! we made it to 20M+ downloads per week on npm and 14k+ github stars.</p>
<p>Used in production at <a href="https://github.com/mozilla/fxa/blob/0d380593eb0c70ebf37d6c39495ec64f9d040b9b/libs/accounts/passkey/src/lib/passkey.repository.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mozilla</a>, <a href="https://github.com/bluesky-social/atproto/blob/136e2145b893773a94e9620df37be5215cdb57a3/packages/bsky/src/data-plane/server/indexing/plugins/post.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bluesky</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/calcom/cal.diy/blob/54343aa685ae8f33159d2f485ec4a57bad5c574a/packages/trpc/server/routers/viewer/bookings/get.handler.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cal.com</a>, and built into <a href="https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/blob/70dd1b8193ac91b4a8a5960c27b6fb39c304f8d8/packages/kysely-adapter/src/kysely-adapter.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Better Auth</a>, <a href="https://github.com/immich-app/immich/blob/0733cc10ee7a0c8ebd5d37b1804b5c28944b7cdd/server/src/repositories/asset.repository.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Immich</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/prisma/studio/blob/780cfcc8ec3660a34c2fcdf75f04134c38d95602/data/postgres-core/dml.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prisma Studio</a>.</p>

